!!! About Gdansk

*Gdansk>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gda%C5%84sk* also called "Aurea Porta", Golden Gate, is a charming city in the Baltic Sea. Its Medieval air seduces any attentive spectator. It is a cosmopolitan city with an intense cultural life with a harbor ambiance.

+Gdansk Old Town>file://images/venue/gdansk-main-image.jpg+  Gdańsk Old Town featuring the iconic Crane (Żuraw) on the far right.

