!! Getting to Gdansk

""Tram""

- diagram of tram connections: [ *PDF>https://download.cloudgdansk.pl/ztm-pl/d/2022071758/01-08-2022.pdf* ],
- tram lines going from the city centre: 6, 9, 12,
- For the conference venue you should get off at one of the following stops: "Politechnika" or "Miszewskiego"

""SKM train""

- For the conference venue you should get off at the "Gdańsk Politechnika" station
- if you want to catch the SKM train at a larger station (e.g., Gdańsk Główny), make sure you are waiting on the platform that handles SKM trains

""Gdansk airport""

- The most convenient transport from the Gdansk airport is to use the train connecting the “Gdańsk Port Lotniczy” station to the “Gdańsk Wrzeszcz” station (it takes about 25 minutes)

""Recommended carriers""

- Neptun Taxi 048 58 511 15 55
- Hallo TAXI 048 58 19 666

